==== hyperbricks yaml {!{myComponent}} ====
myComponent:
  - type: template
  - querykeys:
      - somequeryparameter
  - queryparams:
      somequeryparameter: helloworld
  - values:
      height: "400"
      src: https://www.youtube.com/embed/tgbNymZ7vqY
      width: "300"
==== explainer ====
The inline template used for rendering.
==== expected json ====
{
  "AllowedQueryKeys": [
    "somequeryparameter"
  ],
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<TEMPLATE>",
  "Enclose": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Inline": "",
  "Items": null,
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
